<Layout title="About — mohinbuilds" description="About Mohin and the build log.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>I'm Mohin. I'm a CS student vibe-coding my first SaaS using Claude Cowork.</p>
  <p>This blog is the build log — what I tried, what broke, what surprised me. Tutorials and tool comparisons when they're useful, build vlogs the rest of the time.</p>
  <p>If something here helps you build your own thing, that's the point. If it doesn't, the RSS feed is at <a href="/rss.xml">/rss.xml</a> and you can leave anytime.</p>
  <h2>What I use</h2>
  <p>Claude Cowork for most of the building. Cursor when I need a heavier IDE. n8n and Make for the automation glue. Cloudflare Pages hosts this blog (free). Astro powers it (also free).</p>
  <h2>Disclosure</h2>
  <p>Some links on this site go to products I use and pay for, and a few of those have affiliate programs. When I link to one of those, the link earns me a small commission if you sign up. It costs you nothing, and I only link tools I'm actually using. If a tool I recommended isn't worth your money, I'll say so directly.</p>
  <p>AI assistance: posts on this site are drafted with AI tools and edited by me. Whenever a post claims first-person experience, that experience is mine.</p>
</Layout>
